# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo AND the working copy, on every
# platform. Repo scripts (e.g. update-skill-feedback.cjs) write LF; without
# this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true expect CRLF and every script
# run leaves phantom "modified" files with zero-byte content diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
